      "arabic": "لوالدها صحبة، ولها إدراك، وتزوجها عثمان، وله معها قصّة في طبقات ابن سعد.\nحرف التاء المثناة\nخال.\nحرف الثاء المثلثة",
      "english": "Her father was a Companion, and she was alive during the Prophet's lifetime. Uthman married her, and an account concerning the two of them appears in Ibn Sa'd's al-Tabaqat.\n\nTHE LETTER TA' (WITH TWO DOTS)\n\nEmpty.\n\nTHE LETTER THA' (WITH THREE DOTS)",
